    acii2uni -f nfd writes NFD of what the build without the layer writes, on 193147 of 200000 random streams (the others have marks out of canonical order); disagreements: 0 ok
    negative control: the build without the layer is not in NFD on 88683 of those streams, so this oracle can fail   ok
