    the limit, nfc: on the 6853 streams with marks out of canonical order (6747 of them a nukta after a halant or an accent) the form is the model's; NFC would reorder, and differs on 6853 ok
    the limit, nfd: on the 6853 streams with marks out of canonical order (6747 of them a nukta after a halant or an accent) the form is the model's; NFD would reorder, and differs on 6853 ok
