    form asis: all 65525 code units of U+0000-U+FFFF but the eleven letters: the new build writes exactly the bytes of the build with patch 0001 alone (65523 bytes) ok
    form nfc : all 65525 code units of U+0000-U+FFFF but the eleven letters: the new build writes exactly the bytes of the build with patch 0001 alone (65523 bytes) ok
    form nfd : all 65525 code units of U+0000-U+FFFF but the eleven letters: the new build writes exactly the bytes of the build with patch 0001 alone (65523 bytes) ok
